{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019TLcydBjLgJSGzZEqqg1iB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (imp/rand × s015/s020/s025/s030). 升级 C8 从 partially_confirmed 到 confirmed。关键：imp_vs_rand d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著，证明 strategy×phase 交互跨架构泛化。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_problems\": 250,\n7\t      \"n_valid\": 244,\n8\t      \"n_bootstrap\": 10000,\n9\t      \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n10\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz\": {\n11\t        \"s015\": 0.24,\n12\t        \"s020\": 0.31,\n13\t        \"s025\": 0.38,\n14\t        \"s030\": 0.43\n15\t      },\n16\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_ci\": {\n17\t        \"s015\": [\n18\t          0.11,\n19\t          0.37\n20\t        ],\n21\t        \"s020\": [\n22\t          0.18,\n23\t          0.44\n24\t        ],\n25\t        \"s025\": [\n26\t          0.25,\n27\t          0.51\n28\t        ],\n29\t        \"s030\": [\n30\t          0.3,\n31\t          0.56\n32\t        ]\n33\t      },\n34\t      \"imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p\": {\n35\t        \"s015\": 0.00032,\n36\t        \"s020\": 8.9e-06,\n37\t        \"s025\": 1.4e-08,\n38\t        \"s030\": 2.1e-10\n39\t      },\n40\t      \"imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p_bonferroni\": {\n41\t        \"s015\": 0.00128,\n42\t        \"s020\": 3.56e-05,\n43\t        \"s025\": 5.6e-08,\n44\t        \"s030\": 8.4e-10\n45\t      },\n46\t      \"significant_bonferroni\": {\n47\t        \"s015\": true,\n48\t        \"s020\": true,\n49\t        \"s025\": true,\n50\t        \"s030\": true\n51\t      },\n52\t      \"bonferroni_significant_count\": 4,\n53\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic\": true,\n54\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n55\t        \"s015\": 1.02,\n56\t        \"s020\": 1.09,\n57\t        \"s025\": 1.12,\n58\t        \"s030\": 1.05\n59\t      },\n60\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_interpretation\": \"all_large (>1.0, CI excludes zero)\",\n61\t      \"phase_gradient_random_dz\": {\n62\t        \"s015\": 0.36,\n63\t        \"s020\": 0.38,\n64\t        \"s025\": 0.42,\n65\t        \"s030\": 0.41\n66\t      },\n67\t      \"phase_gradient_random_interpretation\": \"all_small (0.36-0.42, CI excludes zero — architecture-specific)\",\n68\t      \"median_diff_imp_vs_rand\": {\n69\t        \"s015\": 0.018,\n70\t        \"s020\": 0.052,\n71\t        \"s025\": 0.285,\n72\t        \"s030\": 0.612\n73\t      },\n74\t      \"median_diff_ci\": {\n75\t        \"s015\": [\n76\t          0.004,\n77\t          0.035\n78\t        ],\n79\t        \"s020\": [\n80\t          0.012,\n81\t          0.098\n82\t        ],\n83\t        \"s025\": [\n84\t          0.141,\n85\t          0.442\n86\t        ],\n87\t        \"s030\": [\n88\t          0.318,\n89\t          0.935\n90\t        ]\n91\t      },\n92\t      \"imp_phase_gradient_median_diff\": {\n93\t        \"s015\": 0.085,\n94\t        \"s020\": 0.198,\n95\t        \"s025\": 0.376,\n96\t        \"s030\": 0.748\n97\t      },\n98\t      \"rand_phase_gradient_median_diff\": {\n99\t        \"s015\": 0.041,\n100\t        \"s020\": 0.089,\n101\t        \"s025\": 0.143,\n102\t        \"s030\": 0.221\n103\t      },\n104\t      \"imp_rand_gradient_ratio\": {\n105\t        \"s015\": 2.1,\n106\t        \"s020\": 2.2,\n107\t        \"s025\": 2.6,\n108\t        \"s030\": 3.4\n109\t      }\n110\t    },\n111\t    \"tables\": [\n112\t      {\n113\t        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-architecture imp_vs_rand d_z comparison (n=250)\",\n114\t        \"content\": \"| Sparsity | Qwen2 (n=500) | DeepSeek (n=500) | LLaMA (n=250) |\\n|----------|---------------|------------------|---------------|\\n| s015     | 0.44*         | 0.44*            | 0.24*         |\\n| s020     | 0.63*         | 0.52*            | 0.31*         |\\n| s025     | 0.87*         | 0.68*            | 0.38*         |\\n| s030     | 0.92*         | 0.80*            | 0.43*         |\\n* = Bonferroni p<0.05\\n\"\n115\t      }\n116\t    ],\n117\t    \"figures\": [],\n118\t    \"analysis\": \"C8 升级为 confirmed。关键升级依据：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著， 驳斥 'strategy×phase 交互是 Qwen2 架构 artifact' 假说；(2) d_z 单调递增确认 dose-response； (3) importance phase gradient 全 4 水平 d_z>1.0 证明 phase modulation 跨架构泛化。 限定：LLaMA 上 random 也有 non-trivial phase gradient（d_z 0.36-0.42），strategy-dependence 幅度弱于 Qwen2（ratio 2-3× vs 15-38×）。论文用 \\\"strategy×phase interaction is architecture-universal in direction but architecture-dependent in magnitude\\\" 叙述。\\n\\n\\nn=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z 为 0.19→0.34（单调递增），仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著（p=0.029）。 n=50 的 SE≈0.14 导致估计值噪声大；c8_llama_gpu0_s025 (n=250, importance-only) 已确认 importance phase gradient d_z=1.12 (p=4.3e-39)，表明 importance 信号极强。 n=250 时 SE≈0.063，对 true d_z≥0.35 的效应有 >95% power 检测。 n=50 时 d_z 被低估（样本噪声向零收缩），n=250 精确估计将揭示 true d_z 在 0.38-0.43 区间（s025/s030）。 LLaMA 上 random 也有 phase gradient 是架构特性（MHA vs GQA），但 importance 仍然系统性更大 （ratio 2-3×），足以支持 strategy×phase 交互在 LLaMA 架构上成立。 关键区别：Qwen2/DeepSeek 的 imp_rand_ratio 为 15-38×，LLaMA 为 2-3×——交互存在但弱于 GQA 架构，因为 LLaMA MHA 的 28 heads 使 random pruning 本身就有更大方差（非均匀 head importance）。\\n\"\n119\t  },\n120\t  {\n121\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\",\n122\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 在 GPQA Diamond (n=50) 上的 importance masking phase gradient, sparsity=0.15。验证 compound severity phase modulation 在 graduate-level reasoning 上成立。\\n\",\n123\t    \"results\": {\n124\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n125\t      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA Diamond\",\n126\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n127\t      \"sparsity\": 0.15,\n128\t      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n129\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n130\t        \"high\": {\n131\t          \"median\": 0.012,\n132\t          \"mean\": 0.085,\n133\t          \"ci\": [\n134\t            0.031,\n135\t            0.152\n136\t          ]\n137\t        },\n138\t        \"mid\": {\n139\t          \"median\": 0.145,\n140\t          \"mean\": 0.412,\n141\t          \"ci\": [\n142\t            0.218,\n143\t            0.654\n144\t          ]\n145\t        },\n146\t        \"low\": {\n147\t          \"median\": 0.528,\n148\t          \"mean\": 1.876,\n149\t          \"ci\": [\n150\t            1.124,\n151\t            2.812\n152\t          ]\n153\t        }\n154\t      },\n155\t      \"median_difference\": 0.516,\n156\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n157\t        0.298,\n158\t        0.782\n159\t      ],\n160\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 4e-05,\n161\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.62,\n162\t      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n163\t      \"phase_stats\": {\n164\t        \"high\": {\n165\t          \"n_tokens\": 18500,\n166\t          \"n_segments\": 320\n167\t        },\n168\t        \"mid\": {\n169\t          \"n_tokens\": 22400,\n170\t          \"n_segments\": 245\n171\t        },\n172\t        \"low\": {\n173\t          \"n_tokens\": 35200,\n174\t          \"n_segments\": 410\n175\t        }\n176\t      }\n177\t    },\n178\t    \"tables\": [],\n179\t    \"figures\": [],\n180\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA Diamond 问题需要更长推理链（graduate-level physics/chemistry/biology），thinking phase 占比更高。DeepSeek 在 MATH-500 s015 median_diff=0.39，GPQA 上因推理链更长（~50% more tokens）， low-sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，predicted median_diff 略高（0.52）。 效应量 d_z=0.62 介于 MATH-500 s015 (d_z=0.61) 和 s020 (d_z=0.73) 之间，合理—— GPQA 更难问题有更多 deep thinking tokens 聚集在 low-sparsity phase，放大了 phase gradient。\\n\"\n181\t  },\n182\t  {\n183\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\",\n184\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.20. 验证 dose-response 在 GPQA 上单调递增。\\n\",\n185\t    \"results\": {\n186\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n187\t      \"sparsity\": 0.2,\n188\t      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n189\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n190\t        \"high\": {\n191\t          \"median\": 0.028,\n192\t          \"mean\": 0.195,\n193\t          \"ci\": [\n194\t            0.082,\n195\t            0.338\n196\t          ]\n197\t        },\n198\t        \"mid\": {\n199\t          \"median\": 0.418,\n200\t          \"mean\": 1.352,\n201\t          \"ci\": [\n202\t            0.784,\n203\t            2.106\n204\t          ]\n205\t        },\n206\t        \"low\": {\n207\t          \"median\": 1.825,\n208\t          \"mean\": 6.284,\n209\t          \"ci\": [\n210\t            4.102,\n211\t            9.128\n212\t          ]\n213\t        }\n214\t      },\n215\t      \"median_difference\": 1.797,\n216\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n217\t        1.062,\n218\t        2.684\n219\t      ],\n220\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.2e-07,\n221\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.84,\n222\t      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true\n223\t    },\n224\t    \"tables\": [],\n225\t    \"figures\": [],\n226\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 DS s020 median_diff=1.48, GPQA predicted 1.80 (+22%). 增幅来源： GPQA 推理链更长，low-phase 段落含更多 multi-step deduction，importance scores 的 discrimination collapse 在长链中累积更严重。d_z=0.84 与 MATH-500 s020 (d_z=0.73)  相比偏高，因为 GPQA 的 per-problem 方差更低（问题难度更均匀，都是 graduate-level）。\\n\"\n227\t  },\n228\t  {\n229\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\",\n230\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.25. 验证 strategy specificity（与 random 对比基线）。\\n\",\n231\t    \"results\": {\n232\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n233\t      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n234\t      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n235\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n236\t        \"high\": {\n237\t          \"median\": 0.065,\n238\t          \"mean\": 0.448,\n239\t          \"ci\": [\n240\t            0.215,\n241\t            0.742\n242\t          ]\n243\t        },\n244\t        \"mid\": {\n245\t          \"median\": 1.562,\n246\t          \"mean\": 5.824,\n247\t          \"ci\": [\n248\t            3.412,\n249\t            8.956\n250\t          ]\n251\t        },\n252\t        \"low\": {\n253\t          \"median\": 5.842,\n254\t          \"mean\": 22.156,\n255\t          \"ci\": [\n256\t            15.428,\n257\t            30.612\n258\t          ]\n259\t        }\n260\t      },\n261\t      \"median_difference\": 5.777,\n262\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n263\t        3.824,\n264\t        8.214\n265\t      ],\n266\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 1.4e-09,\n267\t      \"cohens_dz\": 1.05,\n268\t      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true\n269\t    },\n270\t    \"tables\": [],\n271\t    \"figures\": [],\n272\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 DS s025 median_diff=3.99, GPQA predicted 5.78 (+45%). 放大效应增大是因为 s025 时 discrimination collapse 进入非线性区域——pruning 196/784 heads (25%) 后 importance score Gini 系数下降约 6%，在更长的 GPQA 推理链中该 collapse 的 token-level 影响被 multiplicatively 放大。Cohen's d_z 突破 1.0 标志着 strong effect size。\\n\"\n273\t  },\n274\t  {\n275\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\",\n276\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.30. Dose-response 最高点，用于计算 imp/rand ratio。\\n\",\n277\t    \"results\": {\n278\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n279\t      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n280\t      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n281\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n282\t        \"high\": {\n283\t          \"median\": 0.112,\n284\t          \"mean\": 0.824,\n285\t          \"ci\": [\n286\t            0.412,\n287\t            1.356\n288\t          ]\n289\t        },\n290\t        \"mid\": {\n291\t          \"median\": 3.245,\n292\t          \"mean\": 12.562,\n293\t          \"ci\": [\n294\t            7.842,\n295\t            18.924\n296\t          ]\n297\t        },\n298\t        \"low\": {\n299\t          \"median\": 12.856,\n300\t          \"mean\": 52.418,\n301\t          \"ci\": [\n302\t            36.214,\n303\t            72.846\n304\t          ]\n305\t        }\n306\t      },\n307\t      \"median_difference\": 12.744,\n308\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n309\t        8.612,\n310\t        18.256\n311\t      ],\n312\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 3.8e-11,\n313\t      \"cohens_dz\": 1.22,\n314\t      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n315\t      \"dose_response_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n316\t      \"dose_response_sequence\": [\n317\t        0.516,\n318\t        1.797,\n319\t        5.777,\n320\t        12.744\n321\t      ]\n322\t    },\n323\t    \"tables\": [],\n324\t    \"figures\": [],\n325\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 DS s030 median_diff=8.48, GPQA predicted 12.74 (+50%). Severity amplification 在最高 sparsity 处最大——30% head pruning 使 importance scores 几乎完全失去判别力 (Gini delta ≈ -0.08)，KV eviction 本质退化为 biased pseudo-random。GPQA 的 longer reasoning chains (平均 ~1200 tokens thinking vs MATH-500 ~550 tokens) 使这一退化 在更多 segments 上累积，产生更大的 phase gradient。Dose-response 完美单调 (0.52→1.80→5.78→12.74，growth factors 3.5×→3.2×→2.2× 递减 = sub-exponential confirmed)。\\n\"\n326\t  },\n327\t  {\n328\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\",\n329\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25. 基线对照——验证 strategy specificity。\\n\",\n330\t    \"results\": {\n331\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n332\t      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n333\t      \"strategy\": \"random\",\n334\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n335\t        \"high\": {\n336\t          \"median\": 0.682,\n337\t          \"mean\": 2.145,\n338\t          \"ci\": [\n339\t            0.856,\n340\t            3.812\n341\t          ]\n342\t        },\n343\t        \"mid\": {\n344\t          \"median\": 0.845,\n345\t          \"mean\": 1.924,\n346\t          \"ci\": [\n347\t            0.512,\n348\t            3.648\n349\t          ]\n350\t        },\n351\t        \"low\": {\n352\t          \"median\": 1.124,\n353\t          \"mean\": 2.856,\n354\t          \"ci\": [\n355\t            1.245,\n356\t            4.812\n357\t          ]\n358\t        }\n359\t      },\n360\t      \"median_difference\": 0.442,\n361\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n362\t        -0.125,\n363\t        1.048\n364\t      ],\n365\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.062,\n366\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.18,\n367\t      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n368\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 13.1\n369\t    },\n370\t    \"tables\": [],\n371\t    \"figures\": [],\n372\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 n=500 DS random s025 median_diff=0.257 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA n=50 功效较低， random 在 s025 上 borderline NS (p=0.062)。Random 有微弱 phase gradient 但远小于 importance (median_diff 0.44 vs 5.78 = 13.1× ratio)。这与 MATH-500 的 15.5-38.6× ratio 一致（GPQA 稍低因 n=50 noise 更大）。关键：strategy specificity 在 GPQA 上 replicates，importance/random 比值 >5× 证明 phase-dependent compound severity 不是 任何 masking 都会产生的 artifact，而是 importance-specific 的。\\n\"\n373\t  },\n374\t  {\n375\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\",\n376\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30. 最高 sparsity 对照，计算 imp/rand ratio。\\n\",\n377\t    \"results\": {\n378\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n379\t      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n380\t      \"strategy\": \"random\",\n381\t      \"interaction_index\": {\n382\t        \"high\": {\n383\t          \"median\": 1.856,\n384\t          \"mean\": 4.524,\n385\t          \"ci\": [\n386\t            2.412,\n387\t            7.124\n388\t          ]\n389\t        },\n390\t        \"mid\": {\n391\t          \"median\": 2.124,\n392\t          \"mean\": 5.212,\n393\t          \"ci\": [\n394\t            2.856,\n395\t            8.148\n396\t          ]\n397\t        },\n398\t        \"low\": {\n399\t          \"median\": 2.812,\n400\t          \"mean\": 6.148,\n401\t          \"ci\": [\n402\t            3.524,\n403\t            9.412\n404\t          ]\n405\t        }\n406\t      },\n407\t      \"median_difference\": 0.956,\n408\t      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n409\t        0.124,\n410\t        1.842\n411\t      ],\n412\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.018,\n413\t      \"cohens_dz\": 0.28,\n414\t      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n415\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 13.3\n416\t    },\n417\t    \"tables\": [],\n418\t    \"figures\": [],\n419\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 n=500 DS random s030 median_diff=0.51 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA s030 random  median_diff=0.96 略高，因 GPQA 更长推理链使 random masking 的 phase gradient 也有 微弱放大。但 importance/random ratio=13.3× (12.74/0.96) 维持在 [5, 15] 目标区间内。 Random 在 s030 达到统计显著(p=0.018) 与 MATH-500 模式一致——存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025 以上 random 也触发，但 magnitude 远小于 importance。GPQA 复现了 MATH-500  和 GSM8K 的双层结构：(1) phase gradient 存在性跨 strategy 普遍; (2) magnitude  modulation 是 importance-specific（5-15× amplification）。\\n\"\n420\t  },\n421\t  {\n422\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_aggregate_cross_benchmark\",\n423\t    \"description\": \"GPQA 与 MATH-500/GSM8K 三 benchmark 对比综合分析。验证 phase gradient 跨 benchmark  robustness 和 strategy specificity task-modulation。\\n\",\n424\t    \"results\": {\n425\t      \"gpqa_importance_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n426\t      \"gpqa_importance_gradient\": [\n427\t        0.516,\n428\t        1.797,\n429\t        5.777,\n430\t        12.744\n431\t      ],\n432\t      \"math500_importance_gradient\": [\n433\t        0.393,\n434\t        1.215,\n435\t        3.986,\n436\t        8.481\n437\t      ],\n438\t      \"gsm8k_importance_gradient\": [\n439\t        0.241,\n440\t        0.74,\n441\t        1.992,\n442\t        4.682\n443\t      ],\n444\t      \"gpqa_imp_rand_ratio\": {\n445\t        \"s025\": 13.1,\n446\t        \"s030\": 13.3\n447\t      },\n448\t      \"math500_imp_rand_ratio\": {\n449\t        \"s025\": 15.5,\n450\t        \"s030\": 16.6\n451\t      },\n452\t      \"gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio\": {\n453\t        \"s025\": 3.8,\n454\t        \"s030\": 2.8\n455\t      },\n456\t      \"difficulty_ordering\": \"GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\",\n457\t      \"gradient_magnitude_ordering\": \"GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\",\n458\t      \"strategy_specificity_ordering\": \"MATH-500 ≈ GPQA >> GSM8K\",\n459\t      \"cross_benchmark_spearman_rho\": 1.0\n460\t    },\n461\t    \"tables\": [],\n462\t    \"figures\": [],\n463\t    \"analysis\": \"三 benchmark 形成 difficulty gradient：GSM8K (小学数学, short chains) < MATH-500  (竞赛数学, medium chains) < GPQA (graduate-level, long chains)。Phase gradient magnitude 与 benchmark difficulty 正相关——更难的问题需要更长 thinking，low-sparsity phase  accumulates 更多 compound interaction。Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) 在 GPQA  和 MATH-500 上强(13-16×) 而 GSM8K 弱(2.3-3.8×)，因为 GSM8K 推理链短且步骤简单， importance scores 的 discrimination collapse 在短链上影响较小。这证明 strategy specificity 不是 task-specific artifact 而是 reasoning depth-dependent：deeper reasoning →  stronger strategy specificity。GPQA 作为最难 benchmark 上 ratio≥5× 确认了这一点。\\n\"\n464\t  },\n465\t  {\n466\t    \"name\": \"reviewer_outcome_simulation\",\n467\t    \"description\": \"模拟 EMNLP 2026 reviewer 评分和 acceptance outcome，基于 best tier 的完整证据链。\\n\",\n468\t    \"results\": {\n469\t      \"reviewer_1\": {\n470\t        \"overall_score\": 4.0,\n471\t        \"soundness\": 4,\n472\t        \"novelty\": 3.5,\n473\t        \"significance\": 3.5,\n474\t        \"clarity\": 4.0,\n475\t        \"main_concern\": \"Strategy specificity weakens on GSM8K (2-4×) — task-dependence mechanism unclear\",\n476\t        \"novelty_challenge\": false,\n477\t        \"accepts_framing\": true\n478\t      },\n479\t      \"reviewer_2\": {\n480\t        \"overall_score\": 4.2,\n481\t        \"soundness\": 4.5,\n482\t        \"novelty\": 4.0,\n483\t        \"significance\": 3.5,\n484\t        \"clarity\": 4.0,\n485\t        \"main_concern\": \"7B scale only — unclear if effect persists at 70B+\",\n486\t        \"novelty_challenge\": false,\n487\t        \"accepts_framing\": true\n488\t      },\n489\t      \"reviewer_3\": {\n490\t        \"overall_score\": 3.8,\n491\t        \"soundness\": 4.0,\n492\t        \"novelty\": 3.0,\n493\t        \"significance\": 3.5,\n494\t        \"clarity\": 3.5,\n495\t        \"main_concern\": \"Entropy mechanism model-dependent weakens theoretical contribution\",\n496\t        \"novelty_challenge\": true,\n497\t        \"challenge_resolved\": true,\n498\t        \"resolution\": \"50 citations differentiation + empirical finding paper positioning accepted\"\n499\t      },\n500\t      \"average_reviewer_score\": 4.0,\n501\t      \"novelty_challenged_by_reviewers\": 1,\n502\t      \"meta_reviewer_assessment\": \"Solid empirical contribution with thorough cross-validation. Minor concerns about scale generalization and mechanism incompleteness. Recommend accept.\",\n503\t      \"accept_probability\": 0.65,\n504\t      \"decision\": \"accept (poster)\"\n505\t    },\n506\t    \"tables\": [],\n507\t    \"figures\": [],\n508\t    \"analysis\": \"Best tier 假设所有结构性修复被接受。具体映射： (1) 50篇引用 + ThinKV/HIES/Physics of KV Cache 三重区分 → R3 novelty challenge 被 化解，从 \\\"this is already known\\\" 降级为 \\\"minor concern about positioning\\\"; (2) Correlational diagnostic framing → 消除 \\\"importance is broken\\\" 误读，soundness 分数 维持 4.0+（不再被扣 \\\"misleading claim\\\" 分）; (3) p=s 显式声明 + 完整 config → reproducibility concern 消失; (4) Entropy model-dependence → 被接受为 interesting nuance (\\\"cross-model consistency  in Gini collapse is the main story, entropy is secondary\\\"); (5) LLaMA n=250 confirmed → \\\"three models, two architectures\\\" 回应 generalizability; (6) GPQA replication → \\\"three benchmarks spanning elementary to graduate\\\" 加强说服力。 均分 4.0 在 EMNLP 属于 borderline accept → accept 区间。1/3 reviewer challenge novelty 但通过 rebuttal 解决 → 不影响最终决定。Accept probability 0.65 = 中等偏上信心。\\n\"\n509\t  },\n510\t  {\n511\t    \"name\": \"novelty_structural_fix_outcome\",\n512\t    \"description\": \"50篇引用 + 三篇核心区分论文 (Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES) 的 novelty 论证效果评估。\\n\",\n513\t    \"results\": {\n514\t      \"total_citations\": 52,\n515\t      \"key_differentiation_papers\": [\n516\t        {\n517\t          \"paper\": \"Physics of KV Cache Compression (2603.01426)\",\n518\t          \"differentiation\": \"single-axis phase transition vs our compound×phase×strategy\",\n519\t          \"reviewer_acceptance\": true\n520\t        },\n521\t        {\n522\t          \"paper\": \"ThinKV (2510.01290)\",\n523\t          \"differentiation\": \"single-axis phase-aware eviction vs our compound interaction analysis\",\n524\t          \"reviewer_acceptance\": true\n525\t        },\n526\t        {\n527\t          \"paper\": \"HIES (2510.13832)\",\n528\t          \"differentiation\": \"single-axis score collapse → independent supporting evidence for our mechanism\",\n529\t          \"reviewer_acceptance\": true\n530\t        }\n531\t      ],\n532\t      \"related_work_gap_analysis_accepted\": true,\n533\t      \"novelty_score_range\": [\n534\t        3.0,\n535\t        4.0\n536\t      ],\n537\t      \"novelty_mean\": 3.5\n538\t    },\n539\t    \"tables\": [],\n540\t    \"figures\": [],\n541\t    \"analysis\": \"Prior work 分三类且无重叠：(a) compound compression methods (SparK, SLiM) 不分析 phase; (b) single-axis phase-aware (ThinKV, R-KV) 不涉及 compound; (c) phase transition  analysis (Physics of KV Cache) 是 compression-rate phase 不是 reasoning phase。 我们是唯一同时分析 compound × reasoning-phase × strategy 三维交互的。HIES 的  importance score collapse 发现还为 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证。 52 篇引用覆盖了 2024-2026 所有相关工作，reviewer 很难再指出 \\\"missed important prior work\\\"。 Novelty 均分 3.5 = \\\"some novelty\\\" → 对 empirical finding paper 已足够。\\n\"\n542\t  },\n543\t  {\n544\t    \"name\": \"reproducibility_fix_outcome\",\n545\t    \"description\": \"p=s 显式声明 + 完整实验配置描述解决 reproducibility concern 的预期效果。\\n\",\n546\t    \"results\": {\n547\t      \"config_disclosure\": {\n548\t        \"pruning_rate_declaration\": \"p=s (pruning rate equals sparsity level)\",\n549\t        \"head_selection\": \"lowest attention score heads removed\",\n550\t        \"kv_eviction\": \"importance-based: lowest cumulative attention; random: uniform random\",\n551\t        \"phase_segmentation\": \"quantile-based on dense model sparsity profile\",\n552\t        \"bootstrap_params\": \"B=10000, paired per-problem\",\n553\t        \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n554\t        \"seed\": 42\n555\t      },\n556\t      \"reproducibility_concern_raised\": 0,\n557\t      \"appendix_config_table\": true,\n558\t      \"code_release_promised\": true\n559\t    },\n560\t    \"tables\": [],\n561\t    \"figures\": [],\n562\t    \"analysis\": \"RC5 (reproducibility) 的根源是原稿未明确 p=s（pruning rate = sparsity parameter）， reviewer 误以为存在额外 hidden hyperparameter。显式声明 \\\"we set head pruning rate = KV  eviction rate = s for symmetric compound sparsity\\\" + Appendix 完整 config table  (model, sparsity, n_heads_pruned, kv_budget, phase_boundaries, seeds) 使实验完全可复现。 Code release 承诺（camera-ready 时开放）进一步消除疑虑。预期：0 reviewers raise  reproducibility concern（best tier assumption）。\\n\"\n563\t  },\n564\t  {\n565\t    \"name\": \"c8_status_upgrade\",\n566\t    \"description\": \"C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed 后的 claim table 更新和论文叙述调整。\\n\",\n567\t    \"results\": {\n568\t      \"old_status\": \"partially_confirmed\",\n569\t      \"new_status\": \"confirmed\",\n570\t      \"qualification_change\": {\n571\t        \"old\": \"suggests / provides partial support\",\n572\t        \"new\": \"confirms cross-architecture generalization with architecture-dependent magnitude\"\n573\t      },\n574\t      \"paper_language_update\": {\n575\t        \"abstract\": \"Phase-strategy interaction generalizes across three models and two architectures (Qwen2, LLaMA)\",\n576\t        \"conclusion\": \"Cross-architecture replication (n=250) confirms strategy×phase interaction is architecture-universal\"\n577\t      },\n578\t      \"remaining_qualification\": \"magnitude of strategy×phase interaction is architecture-dependent (2-3× on LLaMA vs 15-38× on Qwen2/DeepSeek)\"\n579\t    },\n580\t    \"tables\": [],\n581\t    \"figures\": [],\n582\t    \"analysis\": \"n=50 时 LLaMA imp_vs_rand d_z=0.34 (s030) 仅 borderline significant，限制了 claim 强度。 n=250 功效充分后，s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著 (d_z≥0.38)，确认 strategy×phase 交互 在 LLaMA 架构上统计显著存在（非 sampling noise）。升级 C8 允许论文从 \\\"suggests\\\" 改为  \\\"confirms\\\"，但保留 \\\"architecture-dependent magnitude\\\" 限定——这是诚实的科学陈述， 也预防 reviewer 质疑 \\\"why is LLaMA effect weaker\\\"（主动承认 = 显示 self-awareness）。\\n\"\n583\t  },\n584\t  {\n585\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_strategy_specificity_confirmation\",\n586\t    \"description\": \"GPQA 上 strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio ≥ 5×) 确认后，驳斥 \\\"task-specific artifact\\\" 假说。\\n\",\n587\t    \"results\": {\n588\t      \"gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 13.1,\n589\t      \"gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 13.3,\n590\t      \"math500_imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 15.5,\n591\t      \"math500_imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 16.6,\n592\t      \"gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 3.8,\n593\t      \"gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 2.8,\n594\t      \"pattern\": \"ratio scales with reasoning depth, not task identity\",\n595\t      \"task_specificity_hypothesis_rejected\": true,\n596\t      \"mechanism_explanation\": \"Strategy specificity 与 reasoning depth 正相关：GPQA (long chains) ≈ MATH-500 (medium)  >> GSM8K (short). 这排除了 \\\"specificity is an artifact of MATH-500 problem structure\\\"， 因为相同 pattern 在不同 domain (math vs science) 和 difficulty 上复现。 低 ratio 在 GSM8K 上的原因是：短推理链中 importance scores 的 discrimination collapse 影响有限（fewer tokens accumulated in low-phase），random 和 importance 的 phase  gradient 差异被压缩。\\n\"\n597\t    },\n598\t    \"tables\": [],\n599\t    \"figures\": [],\n600\t    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K ratio 2.3-3.8× 曾引发 \\\"strategy specificity may be benchmark-specific\\\" 担忧。 GPQA ratio 13× (与 MATH-500 15× comparable) 证明 specificity 是 reasoning depth 的 函数而非 task artifact。三 benchmark 形成清晰 pattern：ratio ∝ avg_reasoning_length。 这转化了一个潜在 weakness (GSM8K 低 ratio) 为 additional finding：strategy specificity 的 magnitude 是 reasoning complexity-modulated，为 Discussion §6 提供了额外 insight。\"\n601\t  }\n602\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a2c92b6-6920-467a-95c8-1abdca87fa8d","uuid":"cfa37be7-199f-4413-ab17-ef9f220ec50c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:06:44.551Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T164305/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (imp/rand × s015/s020/s025/s030). 升级 C8 从 partially_confirmed 到 confirmed。关键：imp_vs_rand d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著，证明 strategy×phase 交互跨架构泛化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 250,\n      \"n_valid\": 244,\n      \"n_bootstrap\": 10000,\n      \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.24,\n        \"s020\": 0.31,\n        \"s025\": 0.38,\n        \"s030\": 0.43\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          0.11,\n          0.37\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.18,\n          0.44\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.25,\n          0.51\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.3,\n          0.56\n        ]\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.00032,\n        \"s020\": 8.9e-06,\n        \"s025\": 1.4e-08,\n        \"s030\": 2.1e-10\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p_bonferroni\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.00128,\n        \"s020\": 3.56e-05,\n        \"s025\": 5.6e-08,\n        \"s030\": 8.4e-10\n      },\n      \"significant_bonferroni\": {\n        \"s015\": true,\n        \"s020\": true,\n        \"s025\": true,\n        \"s030\": true\n      },\n      \"bonferroni_significant_count\": 4,\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 1.02,\n        \"s020\": 1.09,\n        \"s025\": 1.12,\n        \"s030\": 1.05\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_interpretation\": \"all_large (>1.0, CI excludes zero)\",\n      \"phase_gradient_random_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.36,\n        \"s020\": 0.38,\n        \"s025\": 0.42,\n        \"s030\": 0.41\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_random_interpretation\": \"all_small (0.36-0.42, CI excludes zero — architecture-specific)\",\n      \"median_diff_imp_vs_rand\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.018,\n        \"s020\": 0.052,\n        \"s025\": 0.285,\n        \"s030\": 0.612\n      },\n      \"median_diff_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          0.004,\n          0.035\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.012,\n          0.098\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.141,\n          0.442\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.318,\n          0.935\n        ]\n      },\n      \"imp_phase_gradient_median_diff\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.085,\n        \"s020\": 0.198,\n        \"s025\": 0.376,\n        \"s030\": 0.748\n      },\n      \"rand_phase_gradient_median_diff\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.041,\n        \"s020\": 0.089,\n        \"s025\": 0.143,\n        \"s030\": 0.221\n      },\n      \"imp_rand_gradient_ratio\": {\n        \"s015\": 2.1,\n        \"s020\": 2.2,\n        \"s025\": 2.6,\n        \"s030\": 3.4\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-architecture imp_vs_rand d_z comparison (n=250)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Sparsity | Qwen2 (n=500) | DeepSeek (n=500) | LLaMA (n=250) |\\n|----------|---------------|------------------|---------------|\\n| s015     | 0.44*         | 0.44*            | 0.24*         |\\n| s020     | 0.63*         | 0.52*            | 0.31*         |\\n| s025     | 0.87*         | 0.68*            | 0.38*         |\\n| s030     | 0.92*         | 0.80*            | 0.43*         |\\n* = Bonferroni p<0.05\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C8 升级为 confirmed。关键升级依据：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著， 驳斥 'strategy×phase 交互是 Qwen2 架构 artifact' 假说；(2) d_z 单调递增确认 dose-response； (3) importance phase gradient 全 4 水平 d_z>1.0 证明 phase modulation 跨架构泛化。 限定：LLaMA 上 random 也有 non-trivial phase gradient（d_z 0.36-0.42），strategy-dependence 幅度弱于 Qwen2（ratio 2-3× vs 15-38×）。论文用 \\\"strategy×phase interaction is architecture-universal in direction but architecture-dependent in magnitude\\\" 叙述。\\n\\n\\nn=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z 为 0.19→0.34（单调递增），仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著（p=0.029）。 n=50 的 SE≈0.14 导致估计值噪声大；c8_llama_gpu0_s025 (n=250, importance-only) 已确认 importance phase gradient d_z=1.12 (p=4.3e-39)，表明 importance 信号极强。 n=250 时 SE≈0.063，对 true d_z≥0.35 的效应有 >95% power 检测。 n=50 时 d_z 被低估（样本噪声向零收缩），n=250 精确估计将揭示 true d_z 在 0.38-0.43 区间（s025/s030）。 LLaMA 上 random 也有 phase gradient 是架构特性（MHA vs GQA），但 importance 仍然系统性更大 （ratio 2-3×），足以支持 strategy×phase 交互在 LLaMA 架构上成立。 关键区别：Qwen2/DeepSeek 的 imp_rand_ratio 为 15-38×，LLaMA 为 2-3×——交互存在但弱于 GQA 架构，因为 LLaMA MHA 的 28 heads 使 random pruning 本身就有更大方差（非均匀 head importance）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 在 GPQA Diamond (n=50) 上的 importance masking phase gradient, sparsity=0.15。验证 compound severity phase modulation 在 graduate-level reasoning 上成立。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA Diamond\",\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.15,\n      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"median\": 0.012,\n          \"mean\": 0.085,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.031,\n            0.152\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"median\": 0.145,\n          \"mean\": 0.412,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.218,\n            0.654\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"median\": 0.528,\n          \"mean\": 1.876,\n          \"ci\": [\n            1.124,\n            2.812\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_difference\": 0.516,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        0.298,\n        0.782\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 4e-05,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.62,\n      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_stats\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"n_tokens\": 18500,\n          \"n_segments\": 320\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"n_tokens\": 22400,\n          \"n_segments\": 245\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"n_tokens\": 35200,\n          \"n_segments\": 410\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA Diamond 问题需要更长推理链（graduate-level physics/chemistry/biology），thinking phase 占比更高。DeepSeek 在 MATH-500 s015 median_diff=0.39，GPQA 上因推理链更长（~50% more tokens）， low-sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，predicted median_diff 略高（0.52）。 效应量 d_z=0.62 介于 MATH-500 s015 (d_z=0.61) 和 s020 (d_z=0.73) 之间，合理—— GPQA 更难问题有更多 deep thinking tokens 聚集在 low-sparsity phase，放大了 phase gradient。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.20. 验证 dose-response 在 GPQA 上单调递增。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"sparsity\": 0.2,\n      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"median\": 0.028,\n          \"mean\": 0.195,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.082,\n            0.338\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"median\": 0.418,\n          \"mean\": 1.352,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.784,\n            2.106\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"median\": 1.825,\n          \"mean\": 6.284,\n          \"ci\": [\n            4.102,\n            9.128\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_difference\": 1.797,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        1.062,\n        2.684\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 8.2e-07,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.84,\n      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 DS s020 median_diff=1.48, GPQA predicted 1.80 (+22%). 增幅来源： GPQA 推理链更长，low-phase 段落含更多 multi-step deduction，importance scores 的 discrimination collapse 在长链中累积更严重。d_z=0.84 与 MATH-500 s020 (d_z=0.73)  相比偏高，因为 GPQA 的 per-problem 方差更低（问题难度更均匀，都是 graduate-level）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.25. 验证 strategy specificity（与 random 对比基线）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"median\": 0.065,\n          \"mean\": 0.448,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.215,\n            0.742\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"median\": 1.562,\n          \"mean\": 5.824,\n          \"ci\": [\n            3.412,\n            8.956\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"median\": 5.842,\n          \"mean\": 22.156,\n          \"ci\": [\n            15.428,\n            30.612\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_difference\": 5.777,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        3.824,\n        8.214\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 1.4e-09,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 1.05,\n      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 DS s025 median_diff=3.99, GPQA predicted 5.78 (+45%). 放大效应增大是因为 s025 时 discrimination collapse 进入非线性区域——pruning 196/784 heads (25%) 后 importance score Gini 系数下降约 6%，在更长的 GPQA 推理链中该 collapse 的 token-level 影响被 multiplicatively 放大。Cohen's d_z 突破 1.0 标志着 strong effect size。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.30. Dose-response 最高点，用于计算 imp/rand ratio。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"median\": 0.112,\n          \"mean\": 0.824,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.412,\n            1.356\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"median\": 3.245,\n          \"mean\": 12.562,\n          \"ci\": [\n            7.842,\n            18.924\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"median\": 12.856,\n          \"mean\": 52.418,\n          \"ci\": [\n            36.214,\n            72.846\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_difference\": 12.744,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        8.612,\n        18.256\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 3.8e-11,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 1.22,\n      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n      \"dose_response_sequence\": [\n        0.516,\n        1.797,\n        5.777,\n        12.744\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 DS s030 median_diff=8.48, GPQA predicted 12.74 (+50%). Severity amplification 在最高 sparsity 处最大——30% head pruning 使 importance scores 几乎完全失去判别力 (Gini delta ≈ -0.08)，KV eviction 本质退化为 biased pseudo-random。GPQA 的 longer reasoning chains (平均 ~1200 tokens thinking vs MATH-500 ~550 tokens) 使这一退化 在更多 segments 上累积，产生更大的 phase gradient。Dose-response 完美单调 (0.52→1.80→5.78→12.74，growth factors 3.5×→3.2×→2.2× 递减 = sub-exponential confirmed)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25. 基线对照——验证 strategy specificity。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"sparsity\": 0.25,\n      \"strategy\": \"random\",\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"median\": 0.682,\n          \"mean\": 2.145,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.856,\n            3.812\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"median\": 0.845,\n          \"mean\": 1.924,\n          \"ci\": [\n            0.512,\n            3.648\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"median\": 1.124,\n          \"mean\": 2.856,\n          \"ci\": [\n            1.245,\n            4.812\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_difference\": 0.442,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        -0.125,\n        1.048\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.062,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.18,\n      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 13.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 n=500 DS random s025 median_diff=0.257 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA n=50 功效较低， random 在 s025 上 borderline NS (p=0.062)。Random 有微弱 phase gradient 但远小于 importance (median_diff 0.44 vs 5.78 = 13.1× ratio)。这与 MATH-500 的 15.5-38.6× ratio 一致（GPQA 稍低因 n=50 noise 更大）。关键：strategy specificity 在 GPQA 上 replicates，importance/random 比值 >5× 证明 phase-dependent compound severity 不是 任何 masking 都会产生的 artifact，而是 importance-specific 的。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30. 最高 sparsity 对照，计算 imp/rand ratio。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"sparsity\": 0.3,\n      \"strategy\": \"random\",\n      \"interaction_index\": {\n        \"high\": {\n          \"median\": 1.856,\n          \"mean\": 4.524,\n          \"ci\": [\n            2.412,\n            7.124\n          ]\n        },\n        \"mid\": {\n          \"median\": 2.124,\n          \"mean\": 5.212,\n          \"ci\": [\n            2.856,\n            8.148\n          ]\n        },\n        \"low\": {\n          \"median\": 2.812,\n          \"mean\": 6.148,\n          \"ci\": [\n            3.524,\n            9.412\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      \"median_difference\": 0.956,\n      \"median_difference_ci\": [\n        0.124,\n        1.842\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.018,\n      \"cohens_dz\": 0.28,\n      \"phase_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 13.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH-500 n=500 DS random s030 median_diff=0.51 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA s030 random  median_diff=0.96 略高，因 GPQA 更长推理链使 random masking 的 phase gradient 也有 微弱放大。但 importance/random ratio=13.3× (12.74/0.96) 维持在 [5, 15] 目标区间内。 Random 在 s030 达到统计显著(p=0.018) 与 MATH-500 模式一致——存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025 以上 random 也触发，但 magnitude 远小于 importance。GPQA 复现了 MATH-500  和 GSM8K 的双层结构：(1) phase gradient 存在性跨 strategy 普遍; (2) magnitude  modulation 是 importance-specific（5-15× amplification）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_aggregate_cross_benchmark\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA 与 MATH-500/GSM8K 三 benchmark 对比综合分析。验证 phase gradient 跨 benchmark  robustness 和 strategy specificity task-modulation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gpqa_importance_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"gpqa_importance_gradient\": [\n        0.516,\n        1.797,\n        5.777,\n        12.744\n      ],\n      \"math500_importance_gradient\": [\n        0.393,\n        1.215,\n        3.986,\n        8.481\n      ],\n      \"gsm8k_importance_gradient\": [\n        0.241,\n        0.74,\n        1.992,\n        4.682\n      ],\n      \"gpqa_imp_rand_ratio\": {\n        \"s025\": 13.1,\n        \"s030\": 13.3\n      },\n      \"math500_imp_rand_ratio\": {\n        \"s025\": 15.5,\n        \"s030\": 16.6\n      },\n      \"gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio\": {\n        \"s025\": 3.8,\n        \"s030\": 2.8\n      },\n      \"difficulty_ordering\": \"GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\",\n      \"gradient_magnitude_ordering\": \"GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\",\n      \"strategy_specificity_ordering\": \"MATH-500 ≈ GPQA >> GSM8K\",\n      \"cross_benchmark_spearman_rho\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三 benchmark 形成 difficulty gradient：GSM8K (小学数学, short chains) < MATH-500  (竞赛数学, medium chains) < GPQA (graduate-level, long chains)。Phase gradient magnitude 与 benchmark difficulty 正相关——更难的问题需要更长 thinking，low-sparsity phase  accumulates 更多 compound interaction。Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) 在 GPQA  和 MATH-500 上强(13-16×) 而 GSM8K 弱(2.3-3.8×)，因为 GSM8K 推理链短且步骤简单， importance scores 的 discrimination collapse 在短链上影响较小。这证明 strategy specificity 不是 task-specific artifact 而是 reasoning depth-dependent：deeper reasoning →  stronger strategy specificity。GPQA 作为最难 benchmark 上 ratio≥5× 确认了这一点。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"reviewer_outcome_simulation\",\n    \"description\": \"模拟 EMNLP 2026 reviewer 评分和 acceptance outcome，基于 best tier 的完整证据链。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"reviewer_1\": {\n        \"overall_score\": 4.0,\n        \"soundness\": 4,\n        \"novelty\": 3.5,\n        \"significance\": 3.5,\n        \"clarity\": 4.0,\n        \"main_concern\": \"Strategy specificity weakens on GSM8K (2-4×) — task-dependence mechanism unclear\",\n        \"novelty_challenge\": false,\n        \"accepts_framing\": true\n      },\n      \"reviewer_2\": {\n        \"overall_score\": 4.2,\n        \"soundness\": 4.5,\n        \"novelty\": 4.0,\n        \"significance\": 3.5,\n        \"clarity\": 4.0,\n        \"main_concern\": \"7B scale only — unclear if effect persists at 70B+\",\n        \"novelty_challenge\": false,\n        \"accepts_framing\": true\n      },\n      \"reviewer_3\": {\n        \"overall_score\": 3.8,\n        \"soundness\": 4.0,\n        \"novelty\": 3.0,\n        \"significance\": 3.5,\n        \"clarity\": 3.5,\n        \"main_concern\": \"Entropy mechanism model-dependent weakens theoretical contribution\",\n        \"novelty_challenge\": true,\n        \"challenge_resolved\": true,\n        \"resolution\": \"50 citations differentiation + empirical finding paper positioning accepted\"\n      },\n      \"average_reviewer_score\": 4.0,\n      \"novelty_challenged_by_reviewers\": 1,\n      \"meta_reviewer_assessment\": \"Solid empirical contribution with thorough cross-validation. Minor concerns about scale generalization and mechanism incompleteness. Recommend accept.\",\n      \"accept_probability\": 0.65,\n      \"decision\": \"accept (poster)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Best tier 假设所有结构性修复被接受。具体映射： (1) 50篇引用 + ThinKV/HIES/Physics of KV Cache 三重区分 → R3 novelty challenge 被 化解，从 \\\"this is already known\\\" 降级为 \\\"minor concern about positioning\\\"; (2) Correlational diagnostic framing → 消除 \\\"importance is broken\\\" 误读，soundness 分数 维持 4.0+（不再被扣 \\\"misleading claim\\\" 分）; (3) p=s 显式声明 + 完整 config → reproducibility concern 消失; (4) Entropy model-dependence → 被接受为 interesting nuance (\\\"cross-model consistency  in Gini collapse is the main story, entropy is secondary\\\"); (5) LLaMA n=250 confirmed → \\\"three models, two architectures\\\" 回应 generalizability; (6) GPQA replication → \\\"three benchmarks spanning elementary to graduate\\\" 加强说服力。 均分 4.0 在 EMNLP 属于 borderline accept → accept 区间。1/3 reviewer challenge novelty 但通过 rebuttal 解决 → 不影响最终决定。Accept probability 0.65 = 中等偏上信心。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"novelty_structural_fix_outcome\",\n    \"description\": \"50篇引用 + 三篇核心区分论文 (Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES) 的 novelty 论证效果评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_citations\": 52,\n      \"key_differentiation_papers\": [\n        {\n          \"paper\": \"Physics of KV Cache Compression (2603.01426)\",\n          \"differentiation\": \"single-axis phase transition vs our compound×phase×strategy\",\n          \"reviewer_acceptance\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"paper\": \"ThinKV (2510.01290)\",\n          \"differentiation\": \"single-axis phase-aware eviction vs our compound interaction analysis\",\n          \"reviewer_acceptance\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"paper\": \"HIES (2510.13832)\",\n          \"differentiation\": \"single-axis score collapse → independent supporting evidence for our mechanism\",\n          \"reviewer_acceptance\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"related_work_gap_analysis_accepted\": true,\n      \"novelty_score_range\": [\n        3.0,\n        4.0\n      ],\n      \"novelty_mean\": 3.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Prior work 分三类且无重叠：(a) compound compression methods (SparK, SLiM) 不分析 phase; (b) single-axis phase-aware (ThinKV, R-KV) 不涉及 compound; (c) phase transition  analysis (Physics of KV Cache) 是 compression-rate phase 不是 reasoning phase。 我们是唯一同时分析 compound × reasoning-phase × strategy 三维交互的。HIES 的  importance score collapse 发现还为 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证。 52 篇引用覆盖了 2024-2026 所有相关工作，reviewer 很难再指出 \\\"missed important prior work\\\"。 Novelty 均分 3.5 = \\\"some novelty\\\" → 对 empirical finding paper 已足够。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"reproducibility_fix_outcome\",\n    \"description\": \"p=s 显式声明 + 完整实验配置描述解决 reproducibility concern 的预期效果。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"config_disclosure\": {\n        \"pruning_rate_declaration\": \"p=s (pruning rate equals sparsity level)\",\n        \"head_selection\": \"lowest attention score heads removed\",\n        \"kv_eviction\": \"importance-based: lowest cumulative attention; random: uniform random\",\n        \"phase_segmentation\": \"quantile-based on dense model sparsity profile\",\n        \"bootstrap_params\": \"B=10000, paired per-problem\",\n        \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n        \"seed\": 42\n      },\n      \"reproducibility_concern_raised\": 0,\n      \"appendix_config_table\": true,\n      \"code_release_promised\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RC5 (reproducibility) 的根源是原稿未明确 p=s（pruning rate = sparsity parameter）， reviewer 误以为存在额外 hidden hyperparameter。显式声明 \\\"we set head pruning rate = KV  eviction rate = s for symmetric compound sparsity\\\" + Appendix 完整 config table  (model, sparsity, n_heads_pruned, kv_budget, phase_boundaries, seeds) 使实验完全可复现。 Code release 承诺（camera-ready 时开放）进一步消除疑虑。预期：0 reviewers raise  reproducibility concern（best tier assumption）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c8_status_upgrade\",\n    \"description\": \"C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed 后的 claim table 更新和论文叙述调整。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"old_status\": \"partially_confirmed\",\n      \"new_status\": \"confirmed\",\n      \"qualification_change\": {\n        \"old\": \"suggests / provides partial support\",\n        \"new\": \"confirms cross-architecture generalization with architecture-dependent magnitude\"\n      },\n      \"paper_language_update\": {\n        \"abstract\": \"Phase-strategy interaction generalizes across three models and two architectures (Qwen2, LLaMA)\",\n        \"conclusion\": \"Cross-architecture replication (n=250) confirms strategy×phase interaction is architecture-universal\"\n      },\n      \"remaining_qualification\": \"magnitude of strategy×phase interaction is architecture-dependent (2-3× on LLaMA vs 15-38× on Qwen2/DeepSeek)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"n=50 时 LLaMA imp_vs_rand d_z=0.34 (s030) 仅 borderline significant，限制了 claim 强度。 n=250 功效充分后，s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著 (d_z≥0.38)，确认 strategy×phase 交互 在 LLaMA 架构上统计显著存在（非 sampling noise）。升级 C8 允许论文从 \\\"suggests\\\" 改为  \\\"confirms\\\"，但保留 \\\"architecture-dependent magnitude\\\" 限定——这是诚实的科学陈述， 也预防 reviewer 质疑 \\\"why is LLaMA effect weaker\\\"（主动承认 = 显示 self-awareness）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_strategy_specificity_confirmation\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA 上 strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio ≥ 5×) 确认后，驳斥 \\\"task-specific artifact\\\" 假说。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 13.1,\n      \"gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 13.3,\n      \"math500_imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 15.5,\n      \"math500_imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 16.6,\n      \"gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s025\": 3.8,\n      \"gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s030\": 2.8,\n      \"pattern\": \"ratio scales with reasoning depth, not task identity\",\n      \"task_specificity_hypothesis_rejected\": true,\n      \"mechanism_explanation\": \"Strategy specificity 与 reasoning depth 正相关：GPQA (long chains) ≈ MATH-500 (medium)  >> GSM8K (short). 这排除了 \\\"specificity is an artifact of MATH-500 problem structure\\\"， 因为相同 pattern 在不同 domain (math vs science) 和 difficulty 上复现。 低 ratio 在 GSM8K 上的原因是：短推理链中 importance scores 的 discrimination collapse 影响有限（fewer tokens accumulated in low-phase），random 和 importance 的 phase  gradient 差异被压缩。\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GSM8K ratio 2.3-3.8× 曾引发 \\\"strategy specificity may be benchmark-specific\\\" 担忧。 GPQA ratio 13× (与 MATH-500 15× comparable) 证明 specificity 是 reasoning depth 的 函数而非 task artifact。三 benchmark 形成清晰 pattern：ratio ∝ avg_reasoning_length。 这转化了一个潜在 weakness (GSM8K 低 ratio) 为 additional finding：strategy specificity 的 magnitude 是 reasoning complexity-modulated，为 Discussion §6 提供了额外 insight。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":602,"startLine":1,"totalLines":602}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HDsYLJzDekGrwrV3cUgHHn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — Phase-Gated Compound Sparsity\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 (数值对齐 n=500 registry: DS median_diff 0.39/1.21/3.99/8.48; QW 0.07/0.31/1.07/3.16; Cohen's d registry 0.61→1.13/0.37→1.44; C7+C10 status→confirmed; imp/rand 2.7-15×) | 维护者: Director\n4\t\n5\t## Core Insight\n6\t\n7\tCompound sparsity（attention head pruning + KV cache eviction）的 severity 不是固定常数——它是 eviction strategy 和 reasoning phase 交互的涌现属性。Importance-based eviction 的 compound interaction severity（paired median difference: median(II_low_i − II_high_i)）随 sparsity 单调递增（DeepSeek: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Qwen: 0.07→0.31→1.07→3.16），而 random masking 在 s015/s020 NS，在 s025 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance（DS: 0.257 vs 3.986; QW: 0.393 vs 1.074, 2.7-15×差异），存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025（D063; s030 待定）。Cohen's d（per-problem paired, B=10000）从 medium 到 large（DeepSeek: 0.61→1.13; Qwen: 0.37→1.44，registry cohens_d s015→s030）。LLaMA 跨架构验证（D060）qualitative direction consistent（within-importance d_z~1.0），但 strategy×phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（imp_vs_rand d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。GSM8K 跨 benchmark 验证（D075）：importance masking 的 phase gradient 在 GSM8K 上同样单调递增（QW: 0.039→0.158→1.100→2.092; DS: 0.241→0.740→1.992→4.682），但 strategy specificity（importance/random gradient ratio）从 MATH-500 的 15-36× 衰减至 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8×。注意：\"反转\"仅在原始 II_low 值上（random > importance），phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random。Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 机制是开放问题（见 §6 Discussion）。这一发现挑战了 compound degradation 均匀分布的隐含假设。\n8\t\n9\t**数字基准**：所有数字基于 bf16 per-problem paired 统计量（B=10000 bootstrap）。median_diff 定义为 median(II_low_i − II_high_i)（逐 problem 配对差的中位数）。fp16 旧数据已弃用。\n10\t\n11\t## Narrative Arc\n12\t\n13\tCompound sparsity 是高效 LLM 推理的实用部署需求，但 prior work（SparK, Ada-KV, SLiM）将 compound interaction 视为均匀超可加。我们发现 severity 是 strategy × phase 交互的涌现属性：importance eviction 的 compound interaction 在 low-sparsity phase 远大于 high-sparsity phase（paired median difference 单调递增 0.39→8.48），而 random eviction 在低 sparsity (s015/s020) NS，在 s025+ 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance (2.7-15×)——存在 sparsity threshold (~s020-s025)，低于阈值 compound effect importance-specific，高于阈值两者均触发但 importance 主导。Cross-model replication 方向一致（Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek，onset threshold s≥0.20）。LLaMA 跨架构验证已完成（c3_llama, D060）：qualitative direction consistent（importance phase gradient d_z≈1.0），但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱（d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 也显示非平凡 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），strategy-dependence 强度 architecture-dependent。我们通过 discrimination collapse 机制解释这一现象：head pruning → importance score 的判别力崩塌（Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致）→ importance eviction 退化为有偏伪随机。Attention entropy redistribution 作为 model-dependent secondary effect 在 DeepSeek 上观察到，但在 Qwen 上不稳健（D044）。\n14\t\n15\t**Framing 硬约束（D015）**：\n16\t- MUST: \\\\\\\"emergent phase-strategy interaction\\\\\\\"\n17\t- MUST NOT: \\\\\\\"importance metric limitation / importance is broken\\\\\\\"\n18\t- MUST NOT: claim \\\\\\\"importance masking produces super-additive interaction\\\\\\\" without qualifier — random masking also produces positive II, and at s025+ random is statistically significant (D063). The distinguishing signal is **magnitude gradient** (importance 2.7-15× larger) and **onset threshold** (random NS below ~s020, importance significant from s015+), not the existence of super-additivity itself (D023)\n19\t\n20\t## Core Claims\n21\t\n22\t| ID | Claim | Status | Key Evidence |\n23\t|----|-------|--------|-------------|\n24\t| C1 | Compound sparsity severity is strategy- and task-modulated | confirmed | MATH-500: importance gradient 15-36× random; GSM8K: ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。Phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random 跨 benchmark 成立，但 magnitude ratio task-dependent。Threshold ~s020-s025 (D063) |\n25\t| C2 | Severity is phase-modulated (amplified in low-sparsity phase) | confirmed | bf16 paired median difference 单调递增: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Bonferroni p<0.005 全 4 水平 (D032)。预注册：n=500 后若 QW s015 CI 仍跨零，叙事改为 'compound effect emerges above threshold sparsity (~s020)' |\n26\t| C3 | Phase-strategy crossover exists | confirmed | s=0.25: importance high_phase=0.032 < random=0.818, importance low_phase=7.196 > random=1.363 (bf16) |\n27\t| C4 | Discrimination collapse as primary mechanism; entropy redistribution model-dependent | partially_confirmed | D044: Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致; entropy collapse DeepSeek 一致但 Qwen s025 反转(+0.045) s030≈0。30/30 problems completed. |\n28\t| C5 | Phase-modulated compound severity generalizes across models | confirmed | DeepSeek + Qwen cross-model replication: 方向一致, Cohen's d ρ=1.0, gradient permutation p=0.043. Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek, onset threshold s≥0.20 (S3→C). |\n29\t| C5b | Phase-aware mitigation recovers compound degradation | future_work | D056: pilot 完成 gate_failed。Oracle recovery 18% < 30% gate (Wilcoxon p=0.002)，heuristic 32% 但 CI 跨零。方向正确但效应量不足，需更精细 phase boundary estimation → future work |\n30\t| C6 | Severity gradient is sub-exponential | confirmed | Growth rate decreasing: Δ增长因子 3.8×→4.8×→2.0×（递减） |\n31\t| C7 | Statistical power at n=500 confirms dose-response | confirmed | c2_n500_deepseek (success) + c2_qw_n500_r3 (success): 两模型 n=500 全 4 sparsity Bonferroni p<0.005, Spearman ρ=1.0 |\n32\t| C8 | Cross-architecture validation (LLaMA) | partially_confirmed | D060: within-importance phase gradient 强(d_z~1.0) ✓，但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱(d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 Bonferroni p=0.029 显著)。**关键**：random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient(d_z 0.35→0.44, CI 排除零)，与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。Qualitative direction consistent, quantitative strategy×phase interaction weaker + architecture-dependent。论文禁用 \"confirms\"，改用 \"suggests\"/\"provides partial support\"。 |\n33\t| C9 | Differentiation from Lethe/SparK prior work | planned | Related Work §2 引用区分 + SparK gap analysis |\n34\t| S3→C | Onset threshold is model-dependent (DeepSeek s≥0.15, Qwen s≥0.20) | confirmed | D037/D038: Qwen s015 d_z=0.37 CI含0, s020+ 显著 |\n35\t| C10 | Phase gradient cross-benchmark robust; strategy specificity task-modulated | confirmed | GSM8K DS gradient 0.241→4.682 单调递增; QW gradient 0.039→2.092; imp/rand ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。QW random s025+s030 均 success |\n36\t| S7→C | Dose-response monotonicity (Spearman ρ=1.0) | confirmed | D047: 6-point dose-response, 单调递增 |\n37\t\n38\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n39\t\n40\t### RC1: Generalizability — 7B models only, benchmark scope\n41\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"Results on two 7B models and MATH-500 only. How do we know this generalizes to larger models or other reasoning tasks?\\\"\n42\t- **应对**: 四层泛化证据：(1) Cross-model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct（同架构不同训练，ρ=1.0）(2) Cross-architecture: c3_llama (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, LlamaForCausalLM)，qualitative direction consistent，但需加限定——LLaMA 上 random 也显示 phase gradient，strategy × phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（D060）(3) **Cross-benchmark (D075)**: GSM8K（两模型）phase gradient 单调递增复现（DS: 0.241→4.682; QW: 0.039→2.092），但 strategy specificity ratio 从 MATH-500 15-36× 衰减至 2.3-3.8×，表明 phase modulation 跨 benchmark 稳健而 magnitude modulation task-dependent。Limitations 诚实声明：(a) 7B scale only；(b) strategy specificity 强度 task-dependent（GSM8K 衰减，可能因推理链更短）；(c) LLaMA 跨架构验证 n=50 限制功效；(d) random phase gradient 行为 architecture-dependent。\n43\t- **实验支撑**: C5 (cross-model) + C8 (c3_llama cross-architecture) + C10 (cross-benchmark GSM8K, D075)\n44\t\n45\t### RC2: Mechanism — entropy-discrimination collapse 缺乏直接测量\n46\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"The mechanism is conceptual. Where is the empirical evidence for entropy increase and discrimination collapse?\\\"\n47\t- **应对**: c4_entropy 实验已完成（DeepSeek 30/30 + Qwen 30/30）。D044 结论：Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致（discrimination collapse confirmed）；entropy redistribution 在 DeepSeek 上一致但在 Qwen 上 s025 方向反转、s030 近零（model-dependent）。论文以 discrimination collapse 为主线，entropy 作 DeepSeek 特有的强化因素。\n48\t- **实验支撑**: c4_entropy (DeepSeek DONE) + qwen_c4_entropy (DONE, negative for entropy universality)\n49\t\n50\t### RC3: Practical impact — 没有 throughput 数据\n51\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"No wall-clock or throughput measurements. Is the severity amplification reflected in actual inference speed?\\\"\n52\t- **应对**: 本文定位是 empirical finding paper（发现 + 机制解释），不是 method paper。Throughput 不是 claim 的一部分。Discussion 中明确 phase-gated controller 作为 future direction。\n53\t  - C5b pilot 已完成（D056）：oracle recovery 18%（Wilcoxon p=0.002），heuristic recovery 32%（p=0.024），但两者 95% CI 均跨零。方向正确（Wilcoxon 显著）但效应量不足（未达 30% gate），需更精细的 phase boundary estimation。论文 §6 Discussion 诚实报告 pilot 结果 + future work。\n54\t  - Heuristic > oracle 悖论值得提及：token position ratio 粗粒度划分可能恰好更适合 mitigation 场景，暗示 phase boundary 的最优粒度是开放问题。\n55\t- **实验支撑**: c5b_pilot (gate_failed, D056)\n56\t\n57\t### RC4: Statistical rigor — bootstrap 是否足够\n58\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"Per-problem bootstrap with 50 problems — sufficient sample size?\\\"\n59\t- **应对**: bf16 使用 B=10000 per-problem paired bootstrap，有效配对数 n=49 (DeepSeek) / n=46 (Qwen)；n=500 实验进一步验证 (C7 running)。Permutation test 使用 paired median difference 作为 robust statistic（D032），Bonferroni 校正后全 4 水平 p<0.005。Dose-response 主用 Wilcoxon signed-rank p + median_diff（robust to outliers），Cohen's d 作为辅助效应量（DeepSeek 0.61→1.13, Qwen 0.37→1.44, registry cohens_d s015→s030），注释高 sparsity 下 d 受 outlier-driven variance 影响（DS s020→s025: median 3.3× jump 但 d 非单调，因极端 II 值影响分母，D064）。可在 appendix 补充 per-problem 分布图（已生成 fig4_per_problem_dist.pdf）。\n60\t- **实验支撑**: bf16 permutation test (D032) + Cohen's d per-problem paired (rebootstrap B=10000) + n=500 Wilcoxon (C7 running)\n61\t\n62\t### RC5: Novelty — prior work 是否已覆盖 phase-dependent sparsity\n63\t- **预期质疑**: \"ThinKV and phase-aware methods already consider phase. What's new?\"\n64\t- **应对**: Prior work 在单轴上分析 phase（ThinKV: phase-aware eviction）或 compound（SparK: joint compression）。没有工作同时分析 compound × phase × strategy 的三维交互。Crossover 现象（同一 strategy 在不同 phase 方向反转）是全新发现。Related Work 加 Lethe 引用区分 + SparK 对比。具体区分：\n65\t  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025): 在 KV cache 单轴上做 phase-aware 压缩（按 CoT 阶段差异化 eviction），但不涉及 pruning × eviction 的 compound interaction。我们研究的是双轴（head pruning × KV eviction）compound interaction 如何随 phase 变化，ThinKV 的单轴 phase-aware 策略是我们分析维度的子集。\n66\t  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026): 揭示了单轴 KV 压缩的 phase transition 和 representational rigidity，是机制层面最接近的工作。关键区分：他们刻画的是单一压缩轴上压缩率的 critical threshold（phase transition），我们刻画的是两种压缩方法的 compound interaction severity 如何被 reasoning phase 调制（phase-dependent gradient）——维度正交。\n67\t  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025): 发现 importance score collapse 并提出 entropy 补偿，为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供独立 supporting evidence——他们在单轴上观察到的 score collapse 正是我们在 compound setting 中发现的 Gini/CV 下降的单轴对应。\n68\t  - **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025): 针对 reasoning task 做 KV compression 优化，属于 task-specific method。我们不是提出新方法，而是 mechanistic 分析 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 行为，二者目标不同（optimization vs understanding）。\n69\t- **实验支撑**: C3 (crossover), Related Work §2 的 gap 分析\n70\t\n71\t### RC6: Novelty vs Lethe/SparK\n72\t- **预期质疑**: \"How does this differ from Lethe (AAAI 2026) which also does layer-time-adaptive KV pruning, or SparK which studies compound compression?\"\n73\t- **应对**: Lethe 和 SparK 都没有分析 phase × strategy 的交互效应。Lethe 是 method paper（提出 adaptive eviction 方法），我们是 empirical finding paper（发现 phase-dependent severity gradient）。SparK 研究 compound compression 但将 interaction 视为均匀超可加，我们发现 interaction severity 随 phase 和 strategy 变化。新近工作进一步确认我们的独特定位：\n74\t  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026) 是最近的相关工作，研究单轴压缩的 phase transition 阈值行为。与我们的核心区别：他们的 phase transition 是压缩率维度上的 critical point，我们的 phase-dependent gradient 是 reasoning phase 维度上 compound interaction 的连续调制——两者刻画的 \"phase\" 语义不同（compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase）。\n75\t  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025) 和 **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025) 都在 KV compression 单轴上引入 phase/reasoning awareness，但均未涉及 compound interaction。我们的贡献在于揭示 pruning × eviction 双轴交互如何被 reasoning phase 调制，这是单轴方法无法观察到的涌现现象。\n76\t  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025) 的 importance score collapse 发现为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证，但 HIES 聚焦于单轴补偿方法，未研究 collapse 在 compound setting 中的放大效应。\n77\t  - Related Work §2 明确区分三者定位：Lethe/SparK = method/compound method, ThinKV/R-KV = single-axis phase-aware, Physics of KV = single-axis phase transition, HIES = single-axis collapse。我们 = compound × phase × strategy 三维交互分析。\n78\t- **实验支撑**: 不需要额外实验，仅需 §2 引用区分\n79\t\n80\t## Paper Positioning\n81\t\n82\t**类型**: Empirical finding paper（非 method paper）\n83\t**核心贡献**:\n84\t1. 发现 compound sparsity severity 的 strategy × phase 交互\n85\t2. 量化 severity gradient（bf16 paired median difference 0.39→8.48, Cohen's d 0.61→1.13）和 crossover 现象\n86\t3. 提出 discrimination collapse 机制解释（Gini/CV 跨模型一致；entropy redistribution model-dependent）\n87\t4. Cross-model + cross-architecture (LLaMA) replication 验证泛化性（三模型两架构；LLaMA partially_confirmed，strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent, D060）\n88\t\n89\t**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline 2026-05-25\n90\t**Rebuttal 准备**: Day 9 (2026-05-23) 预留 rebuttal letter 写作时间\n91\t**关键时间线**：\n92\t- Day 9 (2026-05-23): 预留写 rebuttal letter\n93\t- Day 11 (2026-05-25): EMNLP 2026 ARR 截稿\n94\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a2c92b6-6920-467a-95c8-1abdca87fa8d","uuid":"601c5b2c-e583-4198-9802-6a60a2507d23","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:06:44.546Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T164305/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — Phase-Gated Compound Sparsity\n\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 (数值对齐 n=500 registry: DS median_diff 0.39/1.21/3.99/8.48; QW 0.07/0.31/1.07/3.16; Cohen's d registry 0.61→1.13/0.37→1.44; C7+C10 status→confirmed; imp/rand 2.7-15×) | 维护者: Director\n\n## Core Insight\n\nCompound sparsity（attention head pruning + KV cache eviction）的 severity 不是固定常数——它是 eviction strategy 和 reasoning phase 交互的涌现属性。Importance-based eviction 的 compound interaction severity（paired median difference: median(II_low_i − II_high_i)）随 sparsity 单调递增（DeepSeek: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Qwen: 0.07→0.31→1.07→3.16），而 random masking 在 s015/s020 NS，在 s025 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance（DS: 0.257 vs 3.986; QW: 0.393 vs 1.074, 2.7-15×差异），存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025（D063; s030 待定）。Cohen's d（per-problem paired, B=10000）从 medium 到 large（DeepSeek: 0.61→1.13; Qwen: 0.37→1.44，registry cohens_d s015→s030）。LLaMA 跨架构验证（D060）qualitative direction consistent（within-importance d_z~1.0），但 strategy×phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（imp_vs_rand d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。GSM8K 跨 benchmark 验证（D075）：importance masking 的 phase gradient 在 GSM8K 上同样单调递增（QW: 0.039→0.158→1.100→2.092; DS: 0.241→0.740→1.992→4.682），但 strategy specificity（importance/random gradient ratio）从 MATH-500 的 15-36× 衰减至 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8×。注意：\"反转\"仅在原始 II_low 值上（random > importance），phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random。Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 机制是开放问题（见 §6 Discussion）。这一发现挑战了 compound degradation 均匀分布的隐含假设。\n\n**数字基准**：所有数字基于 bf16 per-problem paired 统计量（B=10000 bootstrap）。median_diff 定义为 median(II_low_i − II_high_i)（逐 problem 配对差的中位数）。fp16 旧数据已弃用。\n\n## Narrative Arc\n\nCompound sparsity 是高效 LLM 推理的实用部署需求，但 prior work（SparK, Ada-KV, SLiM）将 compound interaction 视为均匀超可加。我们发现 severity 是 strategy × phase 交互的涌现属性：importance eviction 的 compound interaction 在 low-sparsity phase 远大于 high-sparsity phase（paired median difference 单调递增 0.39→8.48），而 random eviction 在低 sparsity (s015/s020) NS，在 s025+ 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance (2.7-15×)——存在 sparsity threshold (~s020-s025)，低于阈值 compound effect importance-specific，高于阈值两者均触发但 importance 主导。Cross-model replication 方向一致（Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek，onset threshold s≥0.20）。LLaMA 跨架构验证已完成（c3_llama, D060）：qualitative direction consistent（importance phase gradient d_z≈1.0），但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱（d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 也显示非平凡 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），strategy-dependence 强度 architecture-dependent。我们通过 discrimination collapse 机制解释这一现象：head pruning → importance score 的判别力崩塌（Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致）→ importance eviction 退化为有偏伪随机。Attention entropy redistribution 作为 model-dependent secondary effect 在 DeepSeek 上观察到，但在 Qwen 上不稳健（D044）。\n\n**Framing 硬约束（D015）**：\n- MUST: \\\\\\\"emergent phase-strategy interaction\\\\\\\"\n- MUST NOT: \\\\\\\"importance metric limitation / importance is broken\\\\\\\"\n- MUST NOT: claim \\\\\\\"importance masking produces super-additive interaction\\\\\\\" without qualifier — random masking also produces positive II, and at s025+ random is statistically significant (D063). The distinguishing signal is **magnitude gradient** (importance 2.7-15× larger) and **onset threshold** (random NS below ~s020, importance significant from s015+), not the existence of super-additivity itself (D023)\n\n## Core Claims\n\n| ID | Claim | Status | Key Evidence |\n|----|-------|--------|-------------|\n| C1 | Compound sparsity severity is strategy- and task-modulated | confirmed | MATH-500: importance gradient 15-36× random; GSM8K: ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。Phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random 跨 benchmark 成立，但 magnitude ratio task-dependent。Threshold ~s020-s025 (D063) |\n| C2 | Severity is phase-modulated (amplified in low-sparsity phase) | confirmed | bf16 paired median difference 单调递增: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Bonferroni p<0.005 全 4 水平 (D032)。预注册：n=500 后若 QW s015 CI 仍跨零，叙事改为 'compound effect emerges above threshold sparsity (~s020)' |\n| C3 | Phase-strategy crossover exists | confirmed | s=0.25: importance high_phase=0.032 < random=0.818, importance low_phase=7.196 > random=1.363 (bf16) |\n| C4 | Discrimination collapse as primary mechanism; entropy redistribution model-dependent | partially_confirmed | D044: Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致; entropy collapse DeepSeek 一致但 Qwen s025 反转(+0.045) s030≈0。30/30 problems completed. |\n| C5 | Phase-modulated compound severity generalizes across models | confirmed | DeepSeek + Qwen cross-model replication: 方向一致, Cohen's d ρ=1.0, gradient permutation p=0.043. Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek, onset threshold s≥0.20 (S3→C). |\n| C5b | Phase-aware mitigation recovers compound degradation | future_work | D056: pilot 完成 gate_failed。Oracle recovery 18% < 30% gate (Wilcoxon p=0.002)，heuristic 32% 但 CI 跨零。方向正确但效应量不足，需更精细 phase boundary estimation → future work |\n| C6 | Severity gradient is sub-exponential | confirmed | Growth rate decreasing: Δ增长因子 3.8×→4.8×→2.0×（递减） |\n| C7 | Statistical power at n=500 confirms dose-response | confirmed | c2_n500_deepseek (success) + c2_qw_n500_r3 (success): 两模型 n=500 全 4 sparsity Bonferroni p<0.005, Spearman ρ=1.0 |\n| C8 | Cross-architecture validation (LLaMA) | partially_confirmed | D060: within-importance phase gradient 强(d_z~1.0) ✓，但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱(d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 Bonferroni p=0.029 显著)。**关键**：random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient(d_z 0.35→0.44, CI 排除零)，与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。Qualitative direction consistent, quantitative strategy×phase interaction weaker + architecture-dependent。论文禁用 \"confirms\"，改用 \"suggests\"/\"provides partial support\"。 |\n| C9 | Differentiation from Lethe/SparK prior work | planned | Related Work §2 引用区分 + SparK gap analysis |\n| S3→C | Onset threshold is model-dependent (DeepSeek s≥0.15, Qwen s≥0.20) | confirmed | D037/D038: Qwen s015 d_z=0.37 CI含0, s020+ 显著 |\n| C10 | Phase gradient cross-benchmark robust; strategy specificity task-modulated | confirmed | GSM8K DS gradient 0.241→4.682 单调递增; QW gradient 0.039→2.092; imp/rand ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。QW random s025+s030 均 success |\n| S7→C | Dose-response monotonicity (Spearman ρ=1.0) | confirmed | D047: 6-point dose-response, 单调递增 |\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### RC1: Generalizability — 7B models only, benchmark scope\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"Results on two 7B models and MATH-500 only. How do we know this generalizes to larger models or other reasoning tasks?\\\"\n- **应对**: 四层泛化证据：(1) Cross-model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct（同架构不同训练，ρ=1.0）(2) Cross-architecture: c3_llama (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, LlamaForCausalLM)，qualitative direction consistent，但需加限定——LLaMA 上 random 也显示 phase gradient，strategy × phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（D060）(3) **Cross-benchmark (D075)**: GSM8K（两模型）phase gradient 单调递增复现（DS: 0.241→4.682; QW: 0.039→2.092），但 strategy specificity ratio 从 MATH-500 15-36× 衰减至 2.3-3.8×，表明 phase modulation 跨 benchmark 稳健而 magnitude modulation task-dependent。Limitations 诚实声明：(a) 7B scale only；(b) strategy specificity 强度 task-dependent（GSM8K 衰减，可能因推理链更短）；(c) LLaMA 跨架构验证 n=50 限制功效；(d) random phase gradient 行为 architecture-dependent。\n- **实验支撑**: C5 (cross-model) + C8 (c3_llama cross-architecture) + C10 (cross-benchmark GSM8K, D075)\n\n### RC2: Mechanism — entropy-discrimination collapse 缺乏直接测量\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"The mechanism is conceptual. Where is the empirical evidence for entropy increase and discrimination collapse?\\\"\n- **应对**: c4_entropy 实验已完成（DeepSeek 30/30 + Qwen 30/30）。D044 结论：Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致（discrimination collapse confirmed）；entropy redistribution 在 DeepSeek 上一致但在 Qwen 上 s025 方向反转、s030 近零（model-dependent）。论文以 discrimination collapse 为主线，entropy 作 DeepSeek 特有的强化因素。\n- **实验支撑**: c4_entropy (DeepSeek DONE) + qwen_c4_entropy (DONE, negative for entropy universality)\n\n### RC3: Practical impact — 没有 throughput 数据\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"No wall-clock or throughput measurements. Is the severity amplification reflected in actual inference speed?\\\"\n- **应对**: 本文定位是 empirical finding paper（发现 + 机制解释），不是 method paper。Throughput 不是 claim 的一部分。Discussion 中明确 phase-gated controller 作为 future direction。\n  - C5b pilot 已完成（D056）：oracle recovery 18%（Wilcoxon p=0.002），heuristic recovery 32%（p=0.024），但两者 95% CI 均跨零。方向正确（Wilcoxon 显著）但效应量不足（未达 30% gate），需更精细的 phase boundary estimation。论文 §6 Discussion 诚实报告 pilot 结果 + future work。\n  - Heuristic > oracle 悖论值得提及：token position ratio 粗粒度划分可能恰好更适合 mitigation 场景，暗示 phase boundary 的最优粒度是开放问题。\n- **实验支撑**: c5b_pilot (gate_failed, D056)\n\n### RC4: Statistical rigor — bootstrap 是否足够\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"Per-problem bootstrap with 50 problems — sufficient sample size?\\\"\n- **应对**: bf16 使用 B=10000 per-problem paired bootstrap，有效配对数 n=49 (DeepSeek) / n=46 (Qwen)；n=500 实验进一步验证 (C7 running)。Permutation test 使用 paired median difference 作为 robust statistic（D032），Bonferroni 校正后全 4 水平 p<0.005。Dose-response 主用 Wilcoxon signed-rank p + median_diff（robust to outliers），Cohen's d 作为辅助效应量（DeepSeek 0.61→1.13, Qwen 0.37→1.44, registry cohens_d s015→s030），注释高 sparsity 下 d 受 outlier-driven variance 影响（DS s020→s025: median 3.3× jump 但 d 非单调，因极端 II 值影响分母，D064）。可在 appendix 补充 per-problem 分布图（已生成 fig4_per_problem_dist.pdf）。\n- **实验支撑**: bf16 permutation test (D032) + Cohen's d per-problem paired (rebootstrap B=10000) + n=500 Wilcoxon (C7 running)\n\n### RC5: Novelty — prior work 是否已覆盖 phase-dependent sparsity\n- **预期质疑**: \"ThinKV and phase-aware methods already consider phase. What's new?\"\n- **应对**: Prior work 在单轴上分析 phase（ThinKV: phase-aware eviction）或 compound（SparK: joint compression）。没有工作同时分析 compound × phase × strategy 的三维交互。Crossover 现象（同一 strategy 在不同 phase 方向反转）是全新发现。Related Work 加 Lethe 引用区分 + SparK 对比。具体区分：\n  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025): 在 KV cache 单轴上做 phase-aware 压缩（按 CoT 阶段差异化 eviction），但不涉及 pruning × eviction 的 compound interaction。我们研究的是双轴（head pruning × KV eviction）compound interaction 如何随 phase 变化，ThinKV 的单轴 phase-aware 策略是我们分析维度的子集。\n  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026): 揭示了单轴 KV 压缩的 phase transition 和 representational rigidity，是机制层面最接近的工作。关键区分：他们刻画的是单一压缩轴上压缩率的 critical threshold（phase transition），我们刻画的是两种压缩方法的 compound interaction severity 如何被 reasoning phase 调制（phase-dependent gradient）——维度正交。\n  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025): 发现 importance score collapse 并提出 entropy 补偿，为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供独立 supporting evidence——他们在单轴上观察到的 score collapse 正是我们在 compound setting 中发现的 Gini/CV 下降的单轴对应。\n  - **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025): 针对 reasoning task 做 KV compression 优化，属于 task-specific method。我们不是提出新方法，而是 mechanistic 分析 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 行为，二者目标不同（optimization vs understanding）。\n- **实验支撑**: C3 (crossover), Related Work §2 的 gap 分析\n\n### RC6: Novelty vs Lethe/SparK\n- **预期质疑**: \"How does this differ from Lethe (AAAI 2026) which also does layer-time-adaptive KV pruning, or SparK which studies compound compression?\"\n- **应对**: Lethe 和 SparK 都没有分析 phase × strategy 的交互效应。Lethe 是 method paper（提出 adaptive eviction 方法），我们是 empirical finding paper（发现 phase-dependent severity gradient）。SparK 研究 compound compression 但将 interaction 视为均匀超可加，我们发现 interaction severity 随 phase 和 strategy 变化。新近工作进一步确认我们的独特定位：\n  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026) 是最近的相关工作，研究单轴压缩的 phase transition 阈值行为。与我们的核心区别：他们的 phase transition 是压缩率维度上的 critical point，我们的 phase-dependent gradient 是 reasoning phase 维度上 compound interaction 的连续调制——两者刻画的 \"phase\" 语义不同（compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase）。\n  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025) 和 **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025) 都在 KV compression 单轴上引入 phase/reasoning awareness，但均未涉及 compound interaction。我们的贡献在于揭示 pruning × eviction 双轴交互如何被 reasoning phase 调制，这是单轴方法无法观察到的涌现现象。\n  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025) 的 importance score collapse 发现为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证，但 HIES 聚焦于单轴补偿方法，未研究 collapse 在 compound setting 中的放大效应。\n  - Related Work §2 明确区分三者定位：Lethe/SparK = method/compound method, ThinKV/R-KV = single-axis phase-aware, Physics of KV = single-axis phase transition, HIES = single-axis collapse。我们 = compound × phase × strategy 三维交互分析。\n- **实验支撑**: 不需要额外实验，仅需 §2 引用区分\n\n## Paper Positioning\n\n**类型**: Empirical finding paper（非 method paper）\n**核心贡献**:\n1. 发现 compound sparsity severity 的 strategy × phase 交互\n2. 量化 severity gradient（bf16 paired median difference 0.39→8.48, Cohen's d 0.61→1.13）和 crossover 现象\n3. 提出 discrimination collapse 机制解释（Gini/CV 跨模型一致；entropy redistribution model-dependent）\n4. Cross-model + cross-architecture (LLaMA) replication 验证泛化性（三模型两架构；LLaMA partially_confirmed，strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent, D060）\n\n**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline 2026-05-25\n**Rebuttal 准备**: Day 9 (2026-05-23) 预留 rebuttal letter 写作时间\n**关键时间线**：\n- Day 9 (2026-05-23): 预留写 rebuttal letter\n- Day 11 (2026-05-25): EMNLP 2026 ARR 截稿\n","numLines":94,"startLine":1,"totalLines":94}}}
